# {{name}}

An energy workspace for energatron: your meter data, bills, offers and recommendations. It is private: git holds
config and DVC pointers only, and the data stays on this machine unless you back it up somewhere yourself.

```bash
uv run energatron status                     # where things stand, with reminders
uv run energatron land data/landing/         # land what you downloaded into data/landing/
uv run energatron run                        # run the pipeline; the recommendation is in data/reports/
```

The tool's README is the full manual.
